WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.800 --> 00:32.300
"My Rival and Me" (Episode 2)

3
00:37.120 --> 00:37.840
Busy?

4
00:38.000 --> 00:38.800
Look at the sky.

5
00:38.880 --> 00:39.960
So clear.

6
00:40.480 --> 00:41.160
Good work.

7
00:41.320 --> 00:42.320
Look at the trees.

8
00:42.400 --> 00:43.400
So green.

9
00:44.440 --> 00:45.480
Have you eaten?

10
00:45.880 --> 00:46.880
Look at the lights.

11
00:47.040 --> 00:48.040
So... light-like.

12
00:48.320 --> 00:49.000
Niangzi is real!

13
00:49.000 --> 00:50.000
Yanzi,

14
00:50.920 --> 00:52.600
stop fluttering around like a moth.

15
00:54.600 --> 00:56.160
Since when are you so health-conscious?

16
00:56.240 --> 00:56.920
Recently.

17
00:57.080 --> 00:58.240
I've had too much ship candy.

18
00:58.280 --> 00:59.480
I need to take care of myself.

19
01:00.240 --> 01:01.560
Gu Yiliang and I

20
01:01.640 --> 01:03.480
are friends in the industry now.

21
01:03.920 --> 01:05.680
If he has a wedding or a funeral,

22
01:06.200 --> 01:07.560
do you think I'd get invited?

23
01:08.160 --> 01:08.960
Sure, sure.

24
01:09.080 --> 01:10.080
Other people are invited.

25
01:10.080 --> 01:10.560
You,

26
01:10.560 --> 01:11.560
you'd invite yourself.

27
01:12.920 --> 01:13.880
I get it.

28
01:13.881 --> 01:16.240
I'm not your one and only bestie anymore.

29
01:16.960 --> 01:17.960
But showbiz

30
01:18.040 --> 01:19.960
needs a power duo like me and Gu Yiliang.

31
01:21.560 --> 01:22.960
To my friendship with my rival.

32
01:23.360 --> 01:24.000
Cheers!

33
01:24.360 --> 01:25.360
Hmph.

34
01:28.600 --> 01:29.600
Cut!

35
01:30.800 --> 01:31.800
No, Wei.

36
01:31.920 --> 01:33.000
Gu plays your brother.

37
01:33.040 --> 01:35.200
He's going behind your back to seek revenge.

38
01:35.440 --> 01:36.440
When you find out,

39
01:36.441 --> 01:37.600
you should show

40
01:37.880 --> 01:39.600
a tragic resolve to live or die together.

41
01:40.120 --> 01:41.800
You look like you want him dead now!

42
01:42.040 --> 01:42.520
Again.

43
01:42.680 --> 01:43.680
Yes, Director.

44
01:47.800 --> 01:48.800
Either

45
01:48.880 --> 01:49.880
we live together,

46
01:50.320 --> 01:51.320
or

47
01:51.480 --> 01:52.480
we die together.

48
01:52.720 --> 01:53.520
Cut!

49
01:53.720 --> 01:55.096
Are you trying to poke your brother to death?

50
01:55.120 --> 01:56.160
Again.

51
01:56.600 --> 01:57.600
Uh...

52
02:00.240 --> 02:02.040
What's my line again, Director?

53
02:02.280 --> 02:03.040
My line?

54
02:03.200 --> 02:04.280
Whoever dares hurt you,

55
02:04.400 --> 02:05.720
I'll make them pay.

56
02:05.800 --> 02:06.800
Oh.

57
02:07.600 --> 02:08.600
Whoever dares

58
02:08.760 --> 02:09.760
hurt you,

59
02:10.200 --> 02:11.440
I'll make them

60
02:11.720 --> 02:13.160
pay.

61
02:13.960 --> 02:14.960
Cut!

62
02:15.720 --> 02:17.880
Stop making those huge puppy eyes!

63
02:18.880 --> 02:20.680
I swear.

64
02:21.200 --> 02:22.200
I'll keep you

65
02:22.400 --> 02:23.760
safe.

66
02:25.080 --> 02:26.080
Cut!

67
02:26.280 --> 02:28.280
I'll keep you safe.

68
02:29.400 --> 02:30.400
Cut!

69
02:30.600 --> 02:33.120
I'll keep you safe.

70
02:33.440 --> 02:35.040
Cut!

71
02:35.600 --> 02:36.400
It's dark now.

72
02:36.401 --> 02:38.120
Your facial features can go home.

73
02:50.680 --> 02:54.919
Bastard. All these years, and he's still not impotent?

74
02:54.920 --> 02:56.959
If he hadn't been so insatiable,

75
02:56.960 --> 02:59.600
I wouldn't have run off so decisively.

76
03:26.280 --> 03:27.400
You're up.

77
03:28.120 --> 03:29.320
Hungry?

78
03:29.760 --> 03:30.920
I've ordered delivery.

79
03:31.280 --> 03:32.840
Breakfast will be here soon.

80
03:40.760 --> 03:41.760
By the way,

81
03:42.200 --> 03:44.320
you invested in "Lan Jue," right?

82
03:45.359 --> 03:47.480
Both male leads are with Hengtu.

83
03:48.200 --> 03:49.200
So

84
03:49.480 --> 03:50.960
one more of your people

85
03:51.120 --> 03:52.360
shouldn't be a problem, right?

86
03:53.240 --> 03:54.640
I was suddenly recast.

87
03:55.240 --> 03:56.240
Can you look into it?

88
03:59.280 --> 04:00.960
I haven't had an agency for years.

89
04:01.880 --> 04:02.880
As expected,

90
04:02.920 --> 04:05.080
working alone makes you an easy target.

91
04:05.920 --> 04:06.920
Tell me,

92
04:07.200 --> 04:08.520
what if I joined your company?

93
04:09.800 --> 04:11.240
We're so close, after all.

94
04:12.120 --> 04:13.600
I'll send you my management contract.

95
04:13.960 --> 04:15.280
You haven't blocked me, have you?

96
04:17.120 --> 04:18.160
Want a job?

97
04:18.880 --> 04:19.960
Submit a resume.

98
04:20.560 --> 04:21.560
What?

99
04:22.800 --> 04:24.120
At Hengtu,

100
04:24.520 --> 04:26.160
all actors go through the proper process.

101
04:27.760 --> 04:28.760
Cheng, you dog!

102
04:28.840 --> 04:30.320
You want a free ride, huh?

103
04:32.080 --> 04:33.080
Zhu Mingming,

104
04:33.720 --> 04:35.880
that would require your consent.

105
04:37.080 --> 04:38.760
Last night in the bathroom,

106
04:38.920 --> 04:40.440
you were a lust-crazed demon.

107
04:42.120 --> 04:43.880
You were the one forcing yourself on me.

108
04:44.000 --> 04:45.000
What?

109
04:47.400 --> 04:48.760
I forced you?

110
04:49.200 --> 04:50.400
Have you no shame?

111
04:50.800 --> 04:51.800
Let me tell you,

112
04:52.120 --> 04:53.679
I feel like I ate ten packs of fire noodles

113
04:53.680 --> 04:55.240
and three pounds of chilies!

114
04:55.680 --> 04:57.056
If I went to a nursing home like this,

115
04:57.080 --> 04:58.920
I'd be the one getting beaten the most.

116
04:59.480 --> 05:01.800
If you can't handle it, don't start trouble.

117
05:02.640 --> 05:04.400
There's always a price.

118
05:09.280 --> 05:10.760
Mr. Cheng.

119
05:11.120 --> 05:12.720
Mr. Cheng.

120
05:12.960 --> 05:14.160
I was wrong.

121
05:14.480 --> 05:16.200
Be the bigger man and forgive me.

122
05:16.760 --> 05:18.320
We haven't seen each other in ages.

123
05:18.520 --> 05:19.920
I missed you.

124
05:20.080 --> 05:21.480
I couldn't help myself.

125
05:22.160 --> 05:24.920
Even if I wasn't good, I worked hard last night.

126
05:25.560 --> 05:26.560
Please help me.

127
05:31.080 --> 05:33.200
We don't hire through personal connections.

128
05:34.280 --> 05:36.080
I'll count last night as your first interview.

129
05:36.400 --> 05:37.600
Wait to hear from us.

130
05:37.840 --> 05:38.840
You...

131
05:41.280 --> 05:44.240
Hello, your delivery is here.

132
05:48.000 --> 05:49.040
It's spicy.

133
05:49.320 --> 05:50.320
Not suitable for you.

134
05:50.640 --> 05:51.200
Cheng, you dog!

135
05:51.320 --> 05:52.440
Explain yourself!

136
05:56.920 --> 05:57.920
Hello?

137
06:00.160 --> 06:01.160
Really?

138
06:01.480 --> 06:02.960
I'm still playing Chu Feng?

139
06:03.560 --> 06:04.680
Great. Thank you.

140
06:04.800 --> 06:05.800
I'll be right there.

141
06:10.480 --> 06:11.600
Oh...

142
06:11.880 --> 06:13.600
So many failed takes.

143
06:14.120 --> 06:16.680
I've caused Mr. Gu Yiliang so much trouble.

144
06:18.840 --> 06:19.680
Who knew

145
06:19.760 --> 06:22.480
I was the Niangzi fandom's biggest obstacle?

146
06:23.000 --> 06:24.880
Shipping me with Gu Yiliang

147
06:25.200 --> 06:27.160
is shamelessly riding his coattails.

148
06:27.480 --> 06:28.960
Some power duo.

149
06:29.320 --> 06:30.320
The way I just acted,

150
06:30.600 --> 06:32.480
I looked ready to force myself on him.

151
06:32.920 --> 06:33.920
What if

152
06:34.880 --> 06:37.840
he thinks I'm a pervert lusting after his body and soul?

153
06:52.240 --> 06:54.479
Asleep already?

154
06:54.480 --> 06:57.199
Acting with me is an occupational hazard.

155
06:57.200 --> 06:59.399
He might be in a coma now.

156
06:59.400 --> 07:01.599
Gu Yiliang, I'm sorry.

157
07:01.600 --> 07:04.040
You've suffered so much.

158
07:06.400 --> 07:08.520
Is your boss mourning mine?

159
07:08.960 --> 07:10.160
Mourning?

160
07:10.280 --> 07:10.760
No, this is...

161
07:10.761 --> 07:12.680
A blessing! He's praying for him.

162
07:13.120 --> 07:14.120
Leave them alone.

163
07:14.200 --> 07:15.080
I'll buy you a popsicle.

164
07:15.160 --> 07:15.600
Let's go.

165
07:15.600 --> 07:16.000
Wait...

166
07:16.080 --> 07:17.080
Come on.

167
07:37.160 --> 07:39.999
My rival really is gorgeous.

168
07:40.000 --> 07:43.319
Such a small face, such long lashes.

169
07:43.320 --> 07:48.040
That straight nose, those lips...

170
07:52.880 --> 07:53.880
A creature this beautiful

171
07:54.080 --> 07:55.360
could wreak havoc on the world.

172
07:55.960 --> 07:57.120
I should claim him.

173
07:58.920 --> 07:59.920
Claim!

174
08:01.480 --> 08:02.480
Claim!

175
08:05.200 --> 08:06.240
Why can't I claim him?

176
08:08.920 --> 08:09.920
Oh,

177
08:10.240 --> 08:13.320
he's already my internet husband.

178
08:16.800 --> 08:17.800
Wei Yanzi,

179
08:17.880 --> 08:19.120
you've shipped yourself stupid.

180
08:36.920 --> 08:37.680
Yiliang,

181
08:37.680 --> 08:38.440
you're awake.

182
08:38.600 --> 08:39.520
Let's get you changed.

183
08:39.600 --> 08:40.880
The director says we're up next.

184
08:41.040 --> 08:41.480
Xiao Zhang,

185
08:42.040 --> 08:42.560
thanks.

186
08:42.800 --> 08:43.800
You're welcome.

187
08:45.080 --> 08:45.680
For what?

188
08:45.880 --> 08:46.880
The towel.

189
08:46.920 --> 08:47.960
Didn't you give it to me?

190
08:48.680 --> 08:49.680
No.

191
08:51.360 --> 08:52.680
Maybe it was Mr. Wei.

192
08:52.800 --> 08:54.000
He came by earlier.

193
08:54.960 --> 08:56.240
Wei Yanzi?

194
08:57.320 --> 08:58.640
Why didn't he wake me?

195
08:59.200 --> 09:00.520
I don't know.

196
09:01.320 --> 09:03.000
Maybe he didn't want to disturb your rest.

197
09:03.960 --> 09:04.600
Yiliang,

198
09:04.840 --> 09:05.920
I think.

199
09:06.320 --> 09:07.880
Mr. Wei is pretty nice.

200
09:08.160 --> 09:10.160
He's nothing like the rumors.

201
09:10.520 --> 09:11.360
And

202
09:11.520 --> 09:13.240
he really seems to care about you.

203
09:14.600 --> 09:15.600
He

204
09:16.640 --> 09:17.760
might be your fan.

205
09:20.840 --> 09:21.840
Really?

206
09:49.160 --> 09:50.160
Just for today,

207
09:50.240 --> 09:51.280
I'll splurge

208
09:51.640 --> 09:52.640
and take a cab.

209
09:57.013 --> 09:59.280
[Exclusive Personal Care Services Agreement]

210
10:01.039 --> 10:03.239
[Details include a trial period of 6 months at 80% pay]

211
10:15.800 --> 10:16.800
Hello?

212
10:16.920 --> 10:17.640
Cheng Yan,

213
10:17.840 --> 10:19.520
you really are a dog!

214
10:19.880 --> 10:21.520
I asked for a management contract.

215
10:22.040 --> 10:23.240
You're hiring a caregiver?

216
10:23.640 --> 10:26.120
Exclusive Personal Care Services Agreement?

217
10:26.640 --> 10:28.480
Party B's probation lasts six months.

218
10:28.713 --> 10:30.553
Salary is 80 percent of the regular rate.

219
10:31.720 --> 10:33.000
In line with market standards.

220
10:33.600 --> 10:34.600
Fine.

221
10:34.720 --> 10:35.920
Then explain

222
10:36.200 --> 10:38.600
why being kept requires a non-compete agreement!

223
10:39.160 --> 10:40.840
If Party B terminates the agreement,

224
10:41.040 --> 10:42.880
they may not take another job in the same role?

225
10:43.120 --> 10:43.520
You dog!

226
10:43.520 --> 10:44.200
You fucking...

227
10:44.201 --> 10:45.216
If you have no objections,

228
10:45.240 --> 10:46.720
print it, sign it, and bring it over.

229
10:47.320 --> 10:48.320
Two copies.

230
10:48.920 --> 10:50.600
The contract takes effect today.

231
10:51.080 --> 10:52.680
We'll reimburse the exact printing cost.

232
10:54.960 --> 10:55.560
You...

233
10:55.640 --> 10:56.640
Hello?

234
11:06.000 --> 11:07.000
Two yuan.

235
11:07.960 --> 11:08.960
Fuck!

236
11:11.040 --> 11:12.040
Stay calm.

237
11:42.600 --> 11:43.960
The author WilliamLianWei

238
11:44.120 --> 11:46.600
is a god-tier Niangzi writer.

239
11:46.893 --> 11:49.773
The new fic is set in "Lan Jue!"

240
11:51.520 --> 11:52.960
A masterpiece!

241
11:53.920 --> 11:55.440
Incest AUs really hit different.

242
11:55.520 --> 11:57.360
This has me grinning like an idiot.

243
11:59.480 --> 12:00.520
Wait, Wei Yanzi.

244
12:01.560 --> 12:03.560
You've caused Gu Yiliang so much trouble.

245
12:04.000 --> 12:05.119
And now you're here

246
12:05.120 --> 12:06.680
using him as shipping material?

247
12:07.000 --> 12:08.000
Is that right?

248
12:08.720 --> 12:09.720
No.

249
12:09.960 --> 12:10.960
No more lust.

250
12:13.280 --> 12:15.120
Wei Yanzi.

251
12:15.840 --> 12:18.039
Gu Yiliang came looking for me.

252
12:18.040 --> 12:19.919
Is my acting so bad

253
12:19.920 --> 12:21.720
he's here to end our friendship?

254
12:23.680 --> 12:24.800
I'm here.

255
12:30.800 --> 12:31.800
Mr. Gu.

256
12:33.200 --> 12:34.200
Take off your clothes.

257
12:37.200 --> 12:38.200
Your neck

258
12:38.560 --> 12:39.560
has a rash.

259
12:41.760 --> 12:42.760
It's hot,

260
12:43.120 --> 12:44.440
and these costumes don't breathe.

261
12:44.600 --> 12:46.280
It looks like heat rash.

262
12:46.880 --> 12:48.200
I brought you some talcum powder.

263
12:51.080 --> 12:53.080
No wonder it's so itchy.

264
12:53.840 --> 12:54.840
Don't scratch.

265
12:55.680 --> 12:56.680
You'll make it red.

266
12:57.760 --> 12:58.840
You're like my cat.

267
12:59.280 --> 13:00.560
Sharp teeth and claws.

268
13:01.560 --> 13:02.639
Calling all Niangzi fans!

269
13:02.640 --> 13:04.039
I can't breathe!

270
13:04.040 --> 13:05.359
All you cat-boy fans,

271
13:05.360 --> 13:07.360
get to work immediately!

272
13:09.240 --> 13:10.240
Wei Yanzi.

273
13:12.600 --> 13:14.760
I said I'd put powder on you.

274
13:16.160 --> 13:17.160
Okay.

275
13:17.560 --> 13:19.159
Is Gu Yiliang an angel?

276
13:19.160 --> 13:20.919
How can anyone be this kind?

277
13:20.920 --> 13:22.920
I want my rival to adopt me.

278
13:23.720 --> 13:24.720
How about

279
13:25.080 --> 13:26.080
I help you?

280
13:27.720 --> 13:29.999
Sure. We're both men. What's the problem?

281
13:30.000 --> 13:31.640
I'd gladly waste away for you.

282
13:34.520 --> 13:35.000
No!

283
13:35.320 --> 13:36.320
I mean,

284
13:36.640 --> 13:38.040
my humble gate opens for you alone.

285
13:40.120 --> 13:40.840
You know what?

286
13:40.841 --> 13:43.600
Just strike me dead with lightning.

287
13:43.840 --> 13:45.720
My life is full of holes.

288
13:45.760 --> 13:46.960
Great ventilation.

289
13:49.600 --> 13:50.600
I never expected

290
13:51.160 --> 13:52.360
you to know so much poetry.

291
13:54.960 --> 13:55.960
I just

292
13:56.000 --> 13:57.000
memorize things quickly.

293
13:57.160 --> 13:58.296
A few reads, and I've got it.

294
13:58.320 --> 14:00.080
But I forget just as quickly.

295
14:00.360 --> 14:02.360
Otherwise, it'd take up too much brain space.

296
14:10.920 --> 14:11.920
Go ahead.

297
14:26.960 --> 14:28.720
You can memorize other people's lines too?

298
14:30.280 --> 14:31.280
Yes.

299
14:32.000 --> 14:33.000
For instance,

300
14:33.840 --> 14:34.840
your eyes,

301
14:35.440 --> 14:36.520
your smile,

302
14:37.400 --> 14:38.560
bright as the stars,

303
14:39.240 --> 14:40.360
gentle as the night breeze,

304
14:41.720 --> 14:44.320
are the most beautiful sights I've ever seen.

305
14:47.960 --> 14:48.960
Yanzi,

306
14:50.920 --> 14:51.920
sorry to interrupt.

307
14:56.800 --> 14:58.960
The fans have half an hour to visit the set.

308
14:59.240 --> 15:00.240
When you're ready,

309
15:00.400 --> 15:01.560
please head over.

310
15:06.880 --> 15:08.160
I'm so worried.

311
15:08.280 --> 15:10.040
Our Yiliang is so accommodating.

312
15:10.280 --> 15:12.880
What if some clingy fame-leech

313
15:13.120 --> 15:14.679
latches onto him?

314
15:14.680 --> 15:16.080
Exactly.

315
15:16.200 --> 15:17.400
I'm so concerned.

316
15:17.560 --> 15:19.320
Our Yanzi is so innocent.

317
15:19.440 --> 15:20.519
I hope he doesn't get fooled

318
15:20.520 --> 15:22.519
by some two-faced fake saint.

319
15:22.520 --> 15:23.400
Exactly.

320
15:23.400 --> 15:24.160
What do you mean?

321
15:24.160 --> 15:24.840
Who do you mean?

322
15:24.960 --> 15:25.640
You.

323
15:25.640 --> 15:26.120
Who?

324
15:26.120 --> 15:26.960
Two-faced fake saint!

325
15:26.960 --> 15:27.480
What did you say?

326
15:27.481 --> 15:29.200
What? I'm talking about you!

327
15:29.440 --> 15:30.360
Am I wrong?

328
15:30.361 --> 15:32.039
The actors are here!

329
15:32.040 --> 15:33.719
- Yanzi! - Yiliang!

330
15:33.720 --> 15:34.440
Long time no see.

331
15:34.441 --> 15:36.839
Hello, everyone! It's been a while.

332
15:36.840 --> 15:37.999
One bag has snacks, the other autographs.

333
15:38.000 --> 15:38.960
Hand them out, please.

334
15:38.960 --> 15:39.280
Sure.

335
15:39.280 --> 15:40.120
Are you tired?

336
15:40.200 --> 15:42.240
No. It must be hot out here.

337
15:42.600 --> 15:45.200
Yanzi, this is a gift from your Meiyan fans.

338
15:46.160 --> 15:47.256
How much did you spend this time?

339
15:47.280 --> 15:48.496
My assistant will reimburse you.

340
15:48.520 --> 15:49.160
No need.

341
15:49.240 --> 15:51.400
Only fans with jobs contributed this time.

342
15:51.440 --> 15:52.840
We didn't take money from students.

343
15:53.080 --> 15:53.680
All right.

344
15:53.960 --> 15:54.640
Thank you, everyone.

345
15:54.880 --> 15:55.880
No more gifts next time.

346
15:55.881 --> 15:57.321
Yiliang, can you do the little ears?

347
15:59.480 --> 16:00.480
Yanzi,

348
16:00.720 --> 16:01.720
your rival and his people

349
16:02.120 --> 16:03.720
haven't been making things hard for you?

350
16:04.400 --> 16:05.400
My rival?

351
16:06.120 --> 16:07.520
See for yourselves.

352
16:10.960 --> 16:11.960
Gu Yiliang,

353
16:13.080 --> 16:14.080
smile.

354
16:16.040 --> 16:17.359
They want a photo of us together.

355
16:17.360 --> 16:18.520
Let's take one back there.

356
16:19.320 --> 16:20.320
Sure.

357
16:20.600 --> 16:20.920
Let's go.

358
16:20.920 --> 16:21.320
Come on.

359
16:21.760 --> 16:22.760
Thanks.

360
16:27.600 --> 16:28.680
Take pictures!

361
16:28.880 --> 16:29.880
- Yanzi! - Yiliang!

362
16:41.400 --> 16:44.679
Come on! Bring on the flashes!

363
16:44.680 --> 16:45.999
Niangzi fans,

364
16:46.000 --> 16:52.320
this stumbling block wants to help build your ship!

365
16:53.400 --> 16:54.400
Are you free tonight?

366
16:54.720 --> 16:55.640
If you are,

367
16:55.720 --> 16:56.840
want to rehearse with me?

368
16:57.160 --> 16:58.360
Am I up to it?

369
16:58.560 --> 17:01.280
I memorize lines, but deliver them without feeling.

370
17:01.880 --> 17:03.520
About today's "I'll keep you safe" scene,

371
17:04.360 --> 17:05.360
I'm sorry.

372
17:06.600 --> 17:07.600
It's fine.

373
17:07.680 --> 17:09.360
We got the last take, didn't we?

374
17:09.840 --> 17:11.080
We didn't fall behind schedule.

375
17:11.400 --> 17:12.400
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

376
17:12.760 --> 17:13.760
Yanzi!

377
17:18.600 --> 17:19.720
Would you like an autograph?

378
17:20.360 --> 17:21.360
Yes.

379
17:22.640 --> 17:23.200
Here.

380
17:23.280 --> 17:24.280
Thank you, Yanzi.

381
17:24.680 --> 17:25.320
You're welcome.

382
17:25.520 --> 17:26.760
Bring someone along next time.

383
17:29.360 --> 17:30.120
Um,

384
17:30.360 --> 17:31.960
could you personalize it?

385
17:32.200 --> 17:33.560
Sure. Who should I make it out to?

386
17:33.880 --> 17:34.880
To.

387
17:35.440 --> 17:36.440
WilliamLianWei.

388
17:41.953 --> 17:46.199
These people on the slide are our Niangzi ship's finest creators.

389
17:46.920 --> 17:48.639
The backbone of Niangzi fanfiction!

390
17:48.640 --> 17:50.199
The great WilliamLianWei!

391
17:50.200 --> 17:51.920
So it's you!

392
17:53.600 --> 17:54.400
It's okay.

393
17:54.520 --> 17:56.240
You don't have to if you don't want to.

394
17:56.880 --> 17:58.240
I want to! Really!

395
18:02.440 --> 18:03.120
Mr. Gu Yiliang!

396
18:03.160 --> 18:04.160
Huh?

397
18:04.440 --> 18:05.440
Can I sign this?

398
18:05.680 --> 18:06.680
Of course.

399
18:07.160 --> 18:08.040
Want me to sign it too?

400
18:08.160 --> 18:08.560
Yes.

401
18:08.720 --> 18:09.280
Sure.

402
18:09.400 --> 18:10.400
Here.

403
18:13.160 --> 18:14.919
Girl, stop squealing!

404
18:14.920 --> 18:18.160
Tonight's new smut will send me into orbit.

405
18:31.760 --> 18:32.200
Oh!

406
18:32.360 --> 18:33.400
No, no.

407
18:34.560 --> 18:35.800
Don't let my name

408
18:36.440 --> 18:37.800
ruin this beautiful moment.

409
18:38.320 --> 18:39.400
I'm not worthy.

410
18:42.440 --> 18:44.480
I'll leave you two alone, then.

411
18:44.880 --> 18:46.040
Get home safely.

412
18:46.240 --> 18:46.760
Okay.

413
18:46.920 --> 18:47.720
Thanks for coming.

414
18:47.720 --> 18:48.240
Bye.

415
18:48.320 --> 18:49.320
Bye!

416
18:49.920 --> 18:51.279
Great WilliamLianWei,

417
18:51.280 --> 18:52.719
I'm waiting for your new fic!

418
18:52.720 --> 18:53.720
Write faster!

419
18:54.120 --> 18:57.320
We're like parents sending our kid to college.

420
18:59.920 --> 19:02.721
I get it. I'm the stumbling block.

421
19:02.746 --> 19:05.413
He's the real Niangzi master.

422
19:05.960 --> 19:06.960
Let's go.

423
19:08.360 --> 19:09.360
Let me carry that.

424
19:10.840 --> 19:12.280
Oh, green.

425
19:12.760 --> 19:13.760
It suits me.

426
19:22.160 --> 19:23.480
Jing, I'm here.

427
19:23.600 --> 19:25.320
I brought you a Mixue lemonade.

428
19:25.640 --> 19:26.640
Thank you, Lucas.

429
19:26.760 --> 19:27.080
Sit down.

430
19:27.160 --> 19:27.560
Okay.

431
19:27.600 --> 19:28.680
I'll get started.

432
19:30.320 --> 19:33.160
I've always thought you suited this role best.

433
19:33.840 --> 19:36.120
Your costume photos looked great too.

434
19:37.880 --> 19:38.999
Sorry. I want this seat.

435
19:39.000 --> 19:40.000
Find somewhere else.

436
19:40.960 --> 19:42.240
Mr. Chi,

437
19:42.600 --> 19:44.880
could you wait over there a moment?

438
19:45.240 --> 19:46.240
Why do his makeup first?

439
19:46.280 --> 19:47.280
I'm due on set!

440
19:49.000 --> 19:50.000
Well...

441
19:51.680 --> 19:52.680
It's okay, Jing.

442
19:53.160 --> 19:54.160
I'll wait.

443
19:54.720 --> 19:55.720
All right.

444
19:57.480 --> 19:58.640
Have a seat, Mr. Chi.

445
20:01.120 --> 20:01.680
Let me tell you,

446
20:01.681 --> 20:02.720
there are some people

447
20:03.080 --> 20:04.640
you shouldn't get too close to.

448
20:05.080 --> 20:06.160
The director said

449
20:06.240 --> 20:07.040
the role of Chu Feng

450
20:07.080 --> 20:08.400
was mine.

451
20:08.600 --> 20:09.600
But would you believe it?

452
20:09.760 --> 20:11.520
Who knows what dirty tricks he pulled

453
20:11.640 --> 20:12.920
or whose strings he pulled?

454
20:13.240 --> 20:14.240
Oh, I know.

455
20:14.880 --> 20:16.440
He found some bald old man

456
20:16.560 --> 20:18.080
to let him in the back door.

457
20:19.120 --> 20:20.120
Hilarious.

458
20:20.960 --> 20:21.960
Hey, what are you doing?

459
20:22.040 --> 20:23.040
That hurts!

460
20:24.280 --> 20:24.800
What?

461
20:25.000 --> 20:26.000
Got a problem with me?

462
20:26.280 --> 20:27.456
You're just a damn makeup artist.

463
20:27.480 --> 20:29.040
Who are you to comment on casting?

464
20:29.720 --> 20:30.920
Do you know who's backing me?

465
20:30.960 --> 20:32.120
Do you want to lose your job?

466
20:33.120 --> 20:33.960
Hurry up.

467
20:34.040 --> 20:35.320
You're so slow.

468
20:37.360 --> 20:38.360
- Keep talking! - Hey!

469
20:38.400 --> 20:40.416
- Ride a sewage truck? Your mouth stinks! - Are you crazy?

470
20:40.440 --> 20:42.040
- Keep talking! - What's wrong with you?

471
20:42.840 --> 20:44.160
You're the one who stole my role?

472
20:44.240 --> 20:44.680
You psycho!

473
20:44.720 --> 20:45.040
Say it!

474
20:45.040 --> 20:46.040
Bastard!

475
20:46.120 --> 20:46.720
No fighting, please!

476
20:46.800 --> 20:48.040
Please stop fighting!

477
20:48.240 --> 20:49.480
Please, stop!

478
21:01.280 --> 21:02.280
I'm sorry

479
21:02.360 --> 21:03.640
I kept you waiting so late.

480
21:04.000 --> 21:04.520
It's fine.

481
21:04.600 --> 21:06.176
We agreed to rehearse back at the hotel.

482
21:06.200 --> 21:07.200
Let's go.

483
21:08.120 --> 21:10.240
I wanted to buy you a late-night meal,

484
21:11.120 --> 21:12.240
but at this hour,

485
21:12.600 --> 21:14.120
all the nearby restaurants are closed.

486
21:14.600 --> 21:15.800
No delivery options either.

487
21:16.400 --> 21:17.080
Come with me.

488
21:17.240 --> 21:18.280
I'll treat you to a feast.

489
21:18.360 --> 21:19.360
A feast?

490
21:22.000 --> 21:23.000
Done for the day.

491
21:23.360 --> 21:24.360
What?

492
21:25.373 --> 21:26.093
Ma'am,

493
21:26.320 --> 21:27.640
I'll treat you to a feast too.

494
21:28.520 --> 21:29.520
I'm not going.

495
21:31.480 --> 21:32.640
Suit yourself.

496
21:42.920 --> 21:44.200
Okay.

497
21:53.760 --> 21:54.760
Let's go.

498
22:10.840 --> 22:12.680
Sorry to keep you waiting, Mr. Gu.

499
22:12.920 --> 22:13.920
Here.

500
22:15.960 --> 22:16.960
One moment.

501
22:22.280 --> 22:23.280
Done!

502
22:24.600 --> 22:25.600
Mr. Gu,

503
22:25.640 --> 22:26.816
this is an unmanned convenience store.

504
22:26.840 --> 22:27.520
Nobody's here at night.

505
22:27.640 --> 22:28.920
No one's going to photograph us.

506
22:29.840 --> 22:30.840
Here.

507
22:31.600 --> 22:33.600
Convenience-store ochazuke.

508
22:33.840 --> 22:35.320
I picked fish balls for the oden.

509
22:35.400 --> 22:37.240
Crab sticks instead of shrimp paste.

510
22:37.480 --> 22:39.080
And a soy-braised beef rice ball.

511
22:42.400 --> 22:43.080
Trust me.

512
22:43.280 --> 22:45.040
It may look bad, but it'll taste great.

513
22:46.240 --> 22:46.880
It's just...

514
22:47.240 --> 22:48.520
I feel like this

515
22:49.000 --> 22:50.360
is exactly my kind of food.

516
22:50.600 --> 22:51.600
Really?

517
22:53.000 --> 22:54.199
All those quizzes I took to unlock fanfics

518
22:54.200 --> 22:56.240
about Gu Yiliang paid off!

519
22:57.360 --> 22:58.360
Dig in.

520
23:01.440 --> 23:02.240
It really is good.

521
23:02.320 --> 23:03.320
Right?

522
23:07.800 --> 23:10.080
How do you know these secret recipes?

523
23:10.160 --> 23:11.656
I used to work at a convenience store.

524
23:11.680 --> 23:14.120
They discounted food close to its expiry date.

525
23:14.280 --> 23:16.440
So I looked up convenience-store recipes.

526
23:17.480 --> 23:18.520
You worked there?

527
23:21.000 --> 23:23.360
I thought you debuted while at university.

528
23:25.920 --> 23:27.240
How did you know that?

529
23:29.920 --> 23:32.160
Xiao Zhang looked up an interview with you.

530
23:32.440 --> 23:33.120
Oh.

531
23:33.240 --> 23:34.320
It was just

532
23:34.400 --> 23:36.440
some college photos that went viral.

533
23:36.520 --> 23:38.000
That's when an agency contacted me.

534
23:38.280 --> 23:39.720
What about you, Mr. Gu?

535
23:40.120 --> 23:41.760
How did you get into acting?

536
23:42.920 --> 23:43.400
My debut?

537
23:43.400 --> 23:43.960
Hey,

538
23:44.200 --> 23:45.200
let me guess.

539
23:45.520 --> 23:46.880
I think you

540
23:46.920 --> 23:48.160
must really love it.

541
23:48.440 --> 23:49.479
Otherwise,

542
23:49.480 --> 23:50.840
you couldn't act so well.

543
23:51.760 --> 23:52.920
If anyone tells me

544
23:53.120 --> 23:55.040
nothing in this world is perfect,

545
23:55.440 --> 23:57.960
I'll show them Gu Yiliang when he's acting.

546
24:00.120 --> 24:01.240
Only when I'm acting?

547
24:02.000 --> 24:02.840
No!

548
24:02.920 --> 24:03.720
Mr. Gu,

549
24:03.880 --> 24:05.360
I mean,

550
24:05.840 --> 24:06.640
I... I think...

551
24:06.720 --> 24:07.720
I'm kidding.

552
24:10.080 --> 24:11.400
Getting into acting

553
24:12.200 --> 24:13.480
was kind of an accident.

554
24:14.960 --> 24:16.080
But when I'm acting,

555
24:16.160 --> 24:17.320
it really does feel good.

556
24:18.720 --> 24:20.520
Like I've come alive in color.

557
24:22.080 --> 24:23.840
Who knows how many years I have left, though?

558
24:25.320 --> 24:26.560
Actors these days

559
24:26.680 --> 24:28.200
are almost being replaced by AI.

560
24:29.840 --> 24:31.040
Not you, Mr. Gu.

561
24:31.200 --> 24:33.280
AI will only replace cream puffs like me.

562
24:33.480 --> 24:35.360
A talented actor like you will keep going.

563
24:35.800 --> 24:37.040
You'll act into old age.

564
24:44.640 --> 24:45.640
Mr. Gu,

565
24:49.920 --> 24:50.920
let's act till we're old.

566
24:51.320 --> 24:52.320
Huh?

567
24:56.680 --> 24:57.760
Mr. Gu,

568
24:57.960 --> 24:58.760
I'll teach you the CEO act.

569
24:58.960 --> 24:59.960
Come on.

570
25:01.440 --> 25:02.440
First,

571
25:02.720 --> 25:03.760
cross your arms.

572
25:05.040 --> 25:06.040
Look down.

573
25:07.200 --> 25:09.320
Look up with a wicked smirk.

574
25:12.200 --> 25:13.000
And here's another one.

575
25:13.040 --> 25:14.040
An idol skill.

576
25:15.360 --> 25:16.360
Little cat ears.

577
25:17.440 --> 25:18.640
Sorry, Mr. Gu.

578
25:19.480 --> 25:20.760
Cat ears.

579
25:23.960 --> 25:25.360
Puppy ears.

580
25:25.600 --> 25:26.840
Here's something even more fun.

581
25:31.680 --> 25:32.480
Open your mouth.

582
25:32.680 --> 25:33.680
Open up.

583
25:34.400 --> 25:35.400
Ah.

584
25:40.080 --> 25:41.640
No, I want a turn too.

585
25:41.920 --> 25:42.480
Open your mouth.

586
25:42.480 --> 25:43.480
My turn, then.

587
25:43.840 --> 25:44.840
Ah.

588
25:44.920 --> 25:45.920
Ah.

589
25:46.320 --> 25:47.320
Ah.

590
25:49.000 --> 25:51.760
Didn't you say this store was unmanned?

591
25:52.520 --> 25:54.640
High schoolers out this late?

592
25:54.880 --> 25:55.880
Must be a secret romance.

593
25:56.120 --> 25:57.120
Let's go.

594
26:14.000 --> 26:15.280
The usual place.

595
26:26.400 --> 26:28.560
Hey! Delivery riders can't enter the complex.

596
26:30.120 --> 26:31.800
You young people work yourselves to death.

597
26:31.840 --> 26:33.520
Taking orders when you're this badly hurt?

598
26:33.680 --> 26:34.680
Sir,

599
26:34.720 --> 26:36.080
I'm not a delivery rider.

600
26:36.280 --> 26:38.280
I just bought this bike secondhand.

601
26:39.120 --> 26:40.400
Then what do you do?

602
26:41.520 --> 26:42.520
Yeah.

603
26:42.600 --> 26:44.040
What do I even do?

604
26:44.520 --> 26:46.280
A workhorse by day,

605
26:46.400 --> 26:48.520
A whore by night.

606
26:50.709 --> 26:52.229
Happy City Convenience Store

607
26:55.110 --> 26:56.556
[Brook Street]

608
26:59.709 --> 27:01.983
[Wang Huanxu: Send me 30,000,000]

609
27:25.560 --> 27:26.760
Mr. Gu.

610
27:28.800 --> 27:29.800
Sorry.

611
27:29.920 --> 27:30.960
I suddenly wanted a smoke.

612
27:31.920 --> 27:34.360
Aren't you afraid I'll expose you with an alt account?

613
27:35.800 --> 27:36.800
You go on ahead.

614
27:37.640 --> 27:38.640
Don't wait for me.

615
27:38.760 --> 27:39.920
I'll head back when I'm done.

616
27:41.080 --> 27:42.080
Okay.

617
27:47.080 --> 27:49.120
Why did he suddenly get so down?

618
27:49.600 --> 27:50.400
Mr. Gu,

619
27:50.400 --> 27:51.400
I'm actually in no rush.

620
27:51.920 --> 27:53.920
Why don't you teach me to smoke?

621
27:55.720 --> 27:56.720
Why?

622
27:56.760 --> 27:57.200
Well,

623
27:57.360 --> 28:00.000
then you won't worry about me exposing you online.

624
28:00.120 --> 28:01.680
We'll be partners in crime.

625
28:05.320 --> 28:07.319
What? Sharing a cigarette?

626
28:07.320 --> 28:08.320
I said partners in crime,

627
28:08.321 --> 28:09.359
not partners in romance.

628
28:09.360 --> 28:11.760
Buddy, remember you're straight?

629
28:37.223 --> 28:38.756
Bonus Content 2: Gu Yiliang's Diary 1

630
28:39.160 --> 28:39.800
Douya,

631
28:40.120 --> 28:41.559
help me record a diary entry.

632
28:41.560 --> 28:42.200
Certainly.

633
28:42.360 --> 28:45.120
I'll help record your feelings at this moment.

634
28:45.360 --> 28:47.040
You may begin.

635
28:47.760 --> 28:49.400
My first week on the "Lan Jue" set

636
28:51.520 --> 28:53.120
has been unexpectedly nice.

637
28:54.560 --> 28:56.360
I wasn't planning to take this role,

638
28:57.280 --> 28:59.120
but the original lead got caught in a scandal.

639
29:00.200 --> 29:02.320
Director Lu is close to Mr. Cheng,

640
29:02.640 --> 29:04.720
so they asked me to fill in.

641
29:07.880 --> 29:09.560
They heard I took on a new project

642
29:11.160 --> 29:12.440
and came asking for money again.

643
29:16.360 --> 29:16.840
Hmm.

644
29:17.000 --> 29:18.480
My rival is in this production too.

645
29:19.640 --> 29:21.320
When people heard we'd be working together,

646
29:22.280 --> 29:24.000
my inbox nearly exploded.

647
29:24.600 --> 29:26.560
My fans all told me to watch out for him.

648
29:27.680 --> 29:30.200
As if my rival were eight feet tall,

649
29:30.680 --> 29:34.200
ready to kill me with a giant serpent spear.

650
29:35.080 --> 29:36.080
Or

651
29:36.600 --> 29:38.440
some wicked snake-headed demon.

652
29:39.760 --> 29:40.240
Understood.

653
29:40.440 --> 29:42.000
Based on your description,

654
29:42.200 --> 29:44.480
I've generated two concept images.

655
29:46.320 --> 29:47.480
That's hideous.

656
29:52.320 --> 29:53.600
This is what he looks like.

657
29:54.840 --> 29:55.840
Cute, right?

658
29:56.520 --> 29:57.080
Understood.

659
29:57.200 --> 29:58.920
My analysis indicates

660
29:59.000 --> 30:01.000
that your rival is not human.

661
30:02.560 --> 30:03.880
Your analysis is wrong.

662
30:04.440 --> 30:05.920
He's a very good person.

663
30:06.600 --> 30:07.600
He's funny,

664
30:08.600 --> 30:09.800
and he bought me milk tea.

665
30:10.080 --> 30:11.480
We added each other on WeChat.

666
30:12.280 --> 30:13.920
The way he did it

667
30:17.440 --> 30:18.680
was rather cute.

668
30:21.560 --> 30:24.800
Is it rude to call a man my age cute?

669
30:25.040 --> 30:26.880
Would that be impolite?

670
30:29.680 --> 30:31.320
But he really is cute.

671
30:33.600 --> 30:35.760
Why did I just say "cute" three times?

672
30:37.200 --> 30:39.480
I've counted for you.

673
30:39.600 --> 30:41.119
Including that and the earlier ones,

674
30:41.120 --> 30:43.520
you've said "cute" five times.

675
30:46.040 --> 30:47.320
Actually, I went to see him

676
30:47.400 --> 30:49.080
because ever since filming started,

677
30:49.360 --> 30:50.880
things kept going wrong.

678
30:51.840 --> 30:53.400
Maybe we really are incompatible.

679
30:54.160 --> 30:55.280
I felt a little rebellious.

680
30:55.800 --> 30:58.280
I wanted to see what would happen if I approached him.

681
31:00.200 --> 31:01.200
And then.

682
31:01.720 --> 31:03.840
I found him watching

683
31:04.040 --> 31:05.880
a show I'd acted in ages ago.

684
31:06.200 --> 31:07.720
He was completely absorbed.

685
31:10.640 --> 31:12.720
Xiao Zhang said he was my fan.

686
31:14.120 --> 31:15.960
He even knew I don't like sweets.

687
31:16.880 --> 31:19.520
He gave me a stress toy and a towel too.

688
31:22.400 --> 31:26.600
So why had he never started a conversation with me?

689
31:27.800 --> 31:29.879
Based on what you've told me,

690
31:29.880 --> 31:32.400
perhaps he was shy.

691
31:34.440 --> 31:35.560
That makes sense.

692
31:36.560 --> 31:37.560
After filming began,

693
31:38.840 --> 31:39.840
I rehearsed with him

694
31:40.040 --> 31:41.840
and tested it for myself.

695
31:43.200 --> 31:44.440
I can guarantee

696
31:45.440 --> 31:47.120
that if the way he acts around me

697
31:47.520 --> 31:49.160
is all an act,

698
31:50.760 --> 31:52.720
I'll quit acting for good.

699
31:54.520 --> 31:56.120
He really isn't calculating.

700
31:56.840 --> 31:58.320
He doesn't keep his guard up at all.

701
32:00.920 --> 32:01.920
Do you understand?

702
32:08.160 --> 32:09.160
Um,

703
32:09.560 --> 32:11.000
when I said "cute,"

704
32:11.680 --> 32:13.400
it's because he's my fan.

705
32:13.680 --> 32:17.280
I meant cute in the way fans are cute.

706
32:17.360 --> 32:18.439
Do you understand?

707
32:18.440 --> 32:20.039
I see.

708
32:20.040 --> 32:22.960
A fan so cute, you said it five times.
